This repository is made available for research transparency and review of the
EMA MICCAI 2026 paper:

Accelerating Chest X-ray Report Generation for Tuberculosis Screening in
Indonesia: An Efficiency-Aware Benchmark of Quantized and Distilled
Vision-Language Models

